        "reference": "FLAVOR_TEXT",
        "subject": "Flavor Text"
      },
      "translations": {
        "en_US": {
          "text": "\"Look, Paju. Wandering unknown skies was our dream, and now we've achieved it.\" - Treyst",
          "locale": "en_US"
        },
        "de_DE": {
          "text": "„Schau, Paju. Es war unser Traum, unbekannte Himmel zu durchstreifen, und jetzt haben wir ihn verwirklicht.“ – Treyst",
          "locale": "de_DE"
        },
        "it_IT": {
          "text": "\"Guarda, Paju. Errare per cieli sconosciuti era il nostro sogno e ora l'abbiamo realizzato.\" - Treyst",
          "locale": "it_IT"
        },
        "es_ES": {
          "text": "«Mira, Paju. Hemos cumplido nuestro sueño de volar por cielos ignotos». — Treyst",
          "locale": "es_ES"
        },
        "fr_FR": {
          "text": "« Regarde, Paju. Arpenter ensemble des ciels inconnus était notre rêve. Et c'est désormais chose faite. » - Treyst",
          "locale": "fr_FR"
        }
      },
      "id": "01JNRGBW1JN4SM8YQ2SPANCFPK",
      "text": "\"Look, Paju. Wandering unknown skies was our dream, and now we've achieved it.\" - Treyst"
    }
  ],
